// The API monolith-init (PID 1 of a container VM) serves over ttRPC on
// vsock port 1025. The VM daemon is the client.
//
// The init mounts the container's disk and serves. The daemon calls Start
// with the process spec (holding it until a console client attaches for a
// foreground run), Wait for the exit, then Shutdown, after which the init
// powers the VM off. The init waits for Shutdown (briefly) so the Wait
// reply is delivered before the VM disappears.

